<title>FRANCE: Unibail H1 net attrib profit steady.</title>
<headline>Unibail H1 net attrib profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   141.8  vs	   140.9</p>
<p>    Exceptional elements			89.1  vs	    81.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Unibail released the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
